nva</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 p-5\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n              <div class=\"h-10 w-10 rounded-xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <span class=\"text-yellow-300\">📘</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"min-w-0\">\n                <p class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Ebook Templates Pro</p>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] rounded-full bg-yellow-400/10 ring-1 ring-yellow-400/20 px-2 py-1 text-yellow-300\">Ebook</span>\n                  <span class=\"text-[10px] rounded-full bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 px-2 py-1 text-zinc-300\">Format: Canva + Docs</span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"mt-5 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500\">\n          Preview only — full vault unlocked after purchase.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->\n    <section class=\"py-12 sm:py-14 border-t border-white/5\">\n      <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n        <div class=\"text-center\">\n          <h2 class=\"text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-semibold\">Real Results from Real People</h2>\n          <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-500\">\n            Join thousands who already unlocked their digital product journey\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white/5 ring-1 ring-white/10 p-6\">\n            <div class=\"text-yellow-400 text-sm\">★★★★★</div>\n            <p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-200\">\n              “Made my first ₹5000 within a week of launching. The product ideas saved me months of research.”\n          